window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-5edcbfbc362994f3"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"diagnose-a-stalled-deal\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">诊断停滞的交易</h1> <p>找出真正的阻碍，以及下一步面向客户的行动。</p> <p>向 ChatGPT 提供阶段历史、已结束的活动、通话记录、邮件、交易讨论串、安全或采购记录和账户背景，然后请它说明阻碍、此前尝试、升级处理路径和下一步行动。</p> <p><a id=\"best-for\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">适合哪些情况</h2> <ul> <li>尽管近期有活动，交易仍停滞不前的情况。</li> <li>需要区分真实客户阻碍与内部流程或跟进缺口的销售团队。</li> <li>需要明确下一步客户沟通和负责人的升级审查。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"skills-plugins\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">技能与插件</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>技能或插件</th> <th>用途</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>$spreadsheets</code></td> <td>从 CRM 数据导出中追踪阶段历史、活动和时间信号。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/google-drive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">google-drive（需联网）</a></td> <td>阅读账户背景、安全或采购记录，以及之前的交易计划。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/slack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">slack（需联网）</a></td> <td>查看交易讨论串和内部升级处理背景。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/gmail\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">gmail（需联网）</a></td> <td>查看有助于解释交易停滞原因的客户和内部邮件历史。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><a id=\"starter-prompt\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">起步提示词</h2> <p>诊断停滞的交易</p> <p>建议推理级别：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">请诊断 [deal or account] 停滞不前的原因。\n\n请使用我提供的商机阶段历史、已结束的活动、通话记录、邮件讨论串、交易讨论串、安全、法律或采购记录，以及账户背景。\n\n请返回：\n- 最可能的阻碍及支持证据\n- 之前尝试过什么，以及发生了哪些变化\n- 客户、技术、法律或采购方面的依赖项\n- 升级处理路径和负责人\n- 下一步面向客户的行动\n- 缺失的背景信息和风险\n\n将有来源支持的事实与推断分开。只起草跟进内容；不要发送，也不要更新 CRM 记录。\n</code></pre> <p><a id=\"related-links\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">关联文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://openai.com/academy/codex-for-work/how-sales-teams-use-codex/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenAI Academy：销售团队（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/codex/use-cases/zoom-meeting-follow-ups\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">将会议转化为跟进事项（需联网）</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>如需查看完整文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可查看该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"trace-the-stall-across-the-full-deal-history\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_6\">沿完整交易历史追踪停滞原因</h2> <p>当前显示的阶段很少能说明全部阻碍。向 ChatGPT 提供阶段历史、已结束的活动、通话、邮件、交易讨论串、安全或采购记录和账户背景，帮助它区分客户、技术、法律和内部流程方面的问题。</p> <ol> <li>说明交易、时间范围，以及诊断需要支持的决策。</li> <li>附上阶段历史、活动、通话记录、邮件、讨论串、安全或采购记录和账户背景。</li> <li>让 ChatGPT 先建立时间线，再判断根本原因。</li> <li>运行起始提示词，审查证据、先前尝试、依赖项、升级路径和下一步行动。</li> <li>发送任何面向客户的跟进内容前，先让交易负责人批准。</li> </ol> <p>诊断应以事实为依据，并限定在明确的时间范围内。如果阻碍尚不确定，请列出能区分不同解释的最小客户或内部核查步骤。</p> <p><a id=\"turn-diagnosis-into-a-recovery-plan\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_7\">把诊断转化为恢复计划</h2> <p>就阻碍达成一致后，请 ChatGPT 制定范围明确的恢复计划，并为每一步列出负责人、依赖项和验证依据。</p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Create a recovery plan for this stalled deal.\n\nInclude:\n\n- confirmed blocker and supporting evidence\n- one or two hypotheses still to test\n- customer-facing next step\n- internal dependency and owner\n- escalation path\n- target date and proof of progress\n- follow-up language for review\n\nDo not send the message, update CRM, or promise a date that the sources do not support.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">请为这笔停滞的交易制定推进恢复计划。\n\n包括：\n\n- 已确认的阻碍及支持证据\n- 一到两个仍需检验的假设\n- 面向客户的下一步行动\n- 内部依赖及负责人\n- 升级处理路径\n- 目标日期和进展证明\n- 供审阅的跟进措辞\n\n不要发送消息、更新 CRM，也不要承诺来源无法支持的日期。</div></div>","en":"<h1 id=\"diagnose-a-stalled-deal\">Diagnose a stalled deal</h1> <p>Find the real blocker and the next customer-facing move.</p> <p>Give ChatGPT stage history, closed activities, call transcripts, emails, deal threads, security or procurement notes, and account context, then ask it to explain the blocker, prior attempts, escalation path, and next action.</p> <h2 id=\"best-for\">Best for</h2> <ul> <li>Deals that have stopped moving despite recent activity.</li> <li>Sales teams separating a real customer blocker from internal process or follow-up gaps.</li> <li>Escalation reviews that need a clear next customer-facing move and owner.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"skills-plugins\">Skills &amp; Plugins</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Skill or plugin</th> <th>Why use it</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>$spreadsheets</code></td> <td>Trace stage history, activity, and timing signals from CRM exports.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/google-drive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">google-drive (online)</a></td> <td>Read account context, security or procurement notes, and prior deal plans.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/slack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">slack (online)</a></td> <td>Review deal threads and internal escalation context.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/gmail\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">gmail (online)</a></td> <td>Check customer and internal email history that explains the stall.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <h2 id=\"starter-prompt\">Starter prompt</h2> <p>Diagnose the stalled deal</p> <p>Suggested reasoning effort：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Diagnose why [deal or account] is stalled.\n\nUse the opportunity stage history, closed activities, call transcripts, email threads, deal threads, security, legal, or procurement notes, and account context I provide.\n\nReturn:\n- the most likely blocker and supporting evidence\n- prior attempts and what changed\n- customer, technical, legal, or procurement dependencies\n- escalation path and owners\n- the next customer-facing move\n- missing context and risks\n\nSeparate sourced facts from inference. Draft follow-up language only; do not send it or update CRM records.\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"related-links\">Related links</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://openai.com/academy/codex-for-work/how-sales-teams-use-codex/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenAI Academy: Sales teams (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/codex/use-cases/zoom-meeting-follow-ups\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Turn meetings into follow-ups (online)</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"trace-the-stall-across-the-full-deal-history\">Trace the stall across the full deal history</h2> <p>The visible stage is rarely the whole blocker. Give ChatGPT stage history, closed activities, calls, emails, deal threads, security or procurement notes, and account context so it can distinguish customer, technical, legal, and internal process issues.</p> <ol> <li>Define the deal, time window, and decision the diagnosis should support.</li> <li>Attach stage history, activity, transcripts, email, threads, security or procurement notes, and account context.</li> <li>Ask ChatGPT to build a timeline before naming a root cause.</li> <li>Run the starter prompt and review evidence, prior attempts, dependencies, escalation path, and next move.</li> <li>Have the deal owner approve any customer-facing follow-up before sending it.</li> </ol> <p>Keep the diagnosis factual and time-bounded. If the blocker is uncertain, list the smallest customer or internal check that would distinguish the competing explanations.</p> <h2 id=\"turn-diagnosis-into-a-recovery-plan\">Turn diagnosis into a recovery plan</h2> <p>After the blocker is agreed, ask ChatGPT to create a narrow recovery plan with owners, dependencies, and a proof point for each step.</p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Create a recovery plan for this stalled deal.\n\nInclude:\n\n- confirmed blocker and supporting evidence\n- one or two hypotheses still to test\n- customer-facing next step\n- internal dependency and owner\n- escalation path\n- target date and proof of progress\n- follow-up language for review\n\nDo not send the message, update CRM, or promise a date that the sources do not support.\n</code></pre>"};
